eam/apps/2111440/extras/fc415fb6a85a980eb6f16c209c517b41.webm?t=1749388562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>At present, we have identified the primary hierarchy and classification of the enemy's frontline forces:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Class 1 &amp; 2: standard assault squads that operate alone or in small groups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Class 3: transport units that deploy assault troops and serve as heavily armed, reinforced combat units in their own right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The enemy possesses technological superiority over humanity, advanced weaponry, modular interchangeable structures, and a complex unit hierarchy. Every battle against them is a serious test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bossfights</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/c4bf297ffbe423165b9c5a063e4b4086.poster.avif?t=1749388562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/c4bf297ffbe423165b9c5a063e4b4086.webm?t=1749388562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>Class 4\u2014Titan Class: resource extraction stations. Complex structures consisting of multiple Class 3 units. Defeating them requires identifying their weak points and employing special tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fighter</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/4386c586d20abcdc2218ac86f293fc54.poster.avif?t=1749388562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/4386c586d20abcdc2218ac86f293fc54.webm?t=1749388562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>The SRJF S-600 M23 &quot;Interceptor&quot; is a cutting-edge short-range jet fighter. It serves as the primary combat unit of orbital defense and can also fulfill a support aircraft role. Capable of operating both in the atmosphere and beyond, though only within a limited range of its carrier ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapons and bonuses</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/f8d9a2284c7ea5ddb7e62f80d05a2c1c.poster.avif?t=1749388562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/f8d9a2284c7ea5ddb7e62f80d05a2c1c.webm?t=1749388562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>The Interceptor is equipped with the latest energy-based weapon systems, featuring various modes of operation. Additionally, it can integrate with external and remote modules to enhance firepower or provide other tactical advantages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>And remember: your forces are not infinite!</strong> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/b36687217d343ac21aa5cbc295c0f802.poster.avif?t=1749388562\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111440/extras/b36687217d343ac21aa5cbc295c0f802.webm?t=1749388562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
